WEBVTT
Language: en-GB

00:00:02.105 --> 00:00:04.315 line:84%
Waste… or resource?

00:00:04.988 --> 00:00:08.348 line:84%
São Paulo produces a great
deal of organic waste,

00:00:08.388 --> 00:00:13.948 line:84%
on farms and in cities – yet only
a small share becomes energy.

00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:17.671 line:84%
To change that, CP2B was born:

00:00:17.711 --> 00:00:22.411 line:84%
the São Paulo Center for
Biogas and Bioproducts Studies!

00:00:23.084 --> 00:00:27.374 line:84%
Based at NIPE, at Unicamp,
and supported by FAPESP.

00:00:28.047 --> 00:00:33.147 line:84%
Our mission: turning waste into biogas,
biomethane and bioproducts —

00:00:33.187 --> 00:00:37.377 line:84%
through science,
technology and social impact.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.650 line:84%
We work as a living lab,
testing solutions in the field —

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:44.760 line:84%
from waste inventories to public policy.

00:00:45.433 --> 00:00:47.783 line:84%
We are a network of researchers,

00:00:47.883 --> 00:00:51.583 line:84%
universities and companies,
in Brazil and abroad.

00:00:52.256 --> 00:00:57.826 line:84%
Driven by excellence, ethics,
diversity and a commitment to society.

00:00:58.499 --> 00:01:02.199 line:84%
We want São Paulo to become
a showcase for biogas solutions —

00:01:02.239 --> 00:01:05.159 line:84%
and a benchmark across Latin America!

00:01:06.009 --> 00:01:11.159 line:84%
CP2B: living energy,
science that transforms!
